  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>About our brand and products: </strong>FREQNC atelier — modern crystal jewelry where fashion meets healing. 100% natural gemstones designed into \"modern talismans.\" Signature: magnetic interchangeable crystal system. AOV ~$100 USD. Stocked at Flying Solo NYC and Wolf &amp; Badger.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>What makes us different: </strong>Not your typical spiritual brand — think Alo Yoga meets crystal jewelry. Grounded, editorial, and made for women who do yoga <em>and</em> drink champagne. Every piece is built around symbolism + real gemstone energy, not generic \"good vibes.\"</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How affiliates can earn: </strong>10% commission on all orders. AOV ~$100 USD. No category exclusions.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How to promote us: </strong>Best fits: spirituality-meets-lifestyle, modern wellness, slow luxury, and editorial jewelry creators. Strong angles: crystal stacking, \"what energy do you need today?\", ritual + lifestyle content, Spirit Animal storytelling. Audience sweet spot: women 25–35 into wellness but grounded in modern life.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Other information: </strong>Website: https://freqncatelier.com ig: @freqnc.atelier</p></div></div>",
